Setting $(x,y,z) = (3,6,-1)$ and $t = 2$ in $3 + 6 + c(-1) = d,$ we get $d = 9 - c.$

Taking $t = -1,$ we get $x + y + cz = d,$ where $(x,y,z) = \begin{pmatrix} 0 \\ -3 \\ 2 \end{pmatrix}.$

